  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Best Farmers Training II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Best Farmers competition is a well-known competition in Uganda that aims to promote farming as a business in Uganda. The Best Farmers are a group of 13 Ugandan farmers who have won this competition as recognition for their outstanding farming efforts. The objective of this training is to support the Best Farmers with the further commercialization of their farming business by teaching relevant knowledge and skills. This training includes the preparation of the Best Farmers for a study trip to the Netherlands and their participation in the Harvest Money Expo as the key agricultural fair in Uganda.</narrative>
  </description>
